<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>License service is the rendering of assistance by a motor club to any person in obtaining:</p><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>Registration of a motor vehicle with the State.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>A driver’s license.</p><p>(c)<span class="EnSpace"/>A transfer of legal or registered ownership upon the records of the Department of Motor Vehicles.</p></caml:Content>